     gate todos 1905-1910 + subtodos 2037-2044, "rungs 0-4", and the ad-hoc
     DEPLOY_MODE modes in deploy.sh. All folded into ONE linear Step sequence (0-7).
   - Kubernetes is now the PRIMARY orchestration path, built on the cluster already
     registered in config/infrastructure/clusters.json (comserv-k8s-cluster @ 192.168.1.50).
   - OPNsense is demoted to "edge/ingress ONLY if actually configured" (it is not today).
