<div class="doc-warning">
    <h3 class="doc-h3">DRAFT  -  AWAITING APPROVAL</h3>
    <p class="doc-body">No cluster change, no registry container, no OPNsense change, and no database replication work occurs until this plan is approved. All remote-execution steps require explicit go-ahead; credentials are handled by the user, not automated scripts.</p>
</div>

