<p class="doc-muted"><strong>Doc currency:</strong> this plan is kept current as Steps complete. Each Step's sub-project of #202 carries its gate; when a Step lands, its sub-project is closed and the section here is marked done with commit evidence. Last reviewed: 2026-08-11 - v2.0 full rewrite: single Step taxonomy, Kubernetes PRIMARY (extends existing .50 cluster), detectability as Step 0, corrected .198/.50 claims, registry-fallback mechanism documented. Supersedes K3S_APP_HA_PLAN v1.13.</p>
